            <ArticleTitle>[Advances in the research of effects of music therapy on pain and anxiety in burn patients].</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>183-5</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>Pain and anxiety engender major psychic problems during all phases of treatment for burn patients. Analgesic alone does not allay these problems satisfactorily in these patients. Music therapy, as an important complementary and alternative therapy, has been widely used in multiple medical fields. However, its positive effect on alleviation of pain and anxiety in burn patients is undefined. The objective of this review is to summarize the feasibility, application fields, methods, and the effectiveness of music therapy in allaying pain and anxiety of burn patients during the whole course of treatment.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
